  "body": "**What happens:** on main (`4827fde6`), `crates/app/tests/lathe_thread_travel.rs:83` fails to compile with E0063 (missing field `hand` in `OpParams::Threading`). So `cargo test -p camcraft-app` (the batch tier) and `cargo clippy --all-targets` fail on main. Found by the review of PR #657.\n\n**Cause:** two PRs merged on 2026-11-10 that each passed alone. PR #643 (#631) added this test building `OpParams::Threading { .. }`; PR #639 (#629) added the required field `hand: ThreadHand` to that variant.\n\n**Fix:** state the hand in the test's params (`hand: ThreadHand::Right`, the default the thread op now uses). Test-only.\n\n**Done means:** `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test lathe_thread_travel` builds and passes on main; clippy `--all-targets` is clean again.\n",
